<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 12.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 12.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samsara (built 1978) 72,200 dwt del Japan prompt via Roberts Bank redel Cape Passero $9,600 daily Deiulemar.</p>
<p>Orhan Ekinci (built 1982) 37,607 dwt del NoPac 15-30/11 redel F.East $7,100 daily plus $105,000 bonus Choyang.</p>
<p>Anangel Power (built 1982) 34,070 del Cont 15-20/11 $10,000 daily Star.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
